# No visible scrollbars

Clipped content may scroll (wheel, trackpad, drag, arrow keys). **Never paint a scrollbar.**

- Do not add native bars (`overflow: auto` is fine; hide the chrome).
- Do not add nano / custom thumbs, hover-reveal bars, or `alwaysShowScrollbar`.
- Use `ScrollArea` or `overflow-*` + the global hide in `src/index.css`.
- Edge fades (`scroll-fade-effect`) are OK; they are not scrollbars.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="overflow-auto">…</div> // without the global hide, or with a visible thumb

// ✅ GOOD
<ScrollArea orientation="both">{children}</ScrollArea>
// or overflow-auto under .lao-app — bars are globally hidden
```
